#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 9f42c61e3e6d486e8e815b02fd1b53f5
#: Intervals.ipynb:9 Multiple Time
msgid "Multiple Time Intervals"
msgstr "多个时间区间"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 9d7f7bfaf68e4d03a54be7861318d098
#: Intervals.ipynb:11 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"You may want to make trading decisions on a different timeframe than your "
"underlying data source. For instance, you might choose to execute trades "
"on daily bars after confirming the trend on weekly or monthly bars. "
"**PyBroker v2** supports compressing backtest data into coarser intervals "
"and making those compressed bars available to your strategy."
msgstr ""
"你可能希望以不同于底层数据源的时间框架来做出交易决策。例如，你可以选择在通"
"过周线或月线确认趋势后，在日线上执行交易。**PyBroker v2** 支持将回测数据压"
"缩为更粗粒度的时间区间，并让这些压缩后的 K 线可供你的策略使用。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 83621ba77e5648288956b96a0fb02f30
#: Intervals.ipynb:23 Multiple Time
msgid "Interval Types"
msgstr "区间类型"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:25 Multiple Time
#: a169a91662884d05aea3987af3fcbefb
msgid "You can define an interval using any of these three formats:"
msgstr "你可以使用以下三种格式中的任意一种来定义时间区间："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 4f0edbe8773b4a46bbb94d15c2239889
#: Intervals.ipynb:27 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"**Every-n-bars** (``int`` greater than ``1``): Compresses every ``n`` "
"base bars into one bar. For example, using ``5`` on daily data produces "
"one bar per five trading days."
msgstr ""
"**每 n 根 K 线** （大于 ``1`` 的 ``int``）：将每 ``n`` 根基础 K 线压缩为一"
"根 K 线。例如，在日线数据上使用 ``5`` 会每五个交易日生成一根 K 线。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:28 Multiple Time
#: b446365d43a94c8ea0d67c8714ba96a8
msgid ""
"**Duration** (``str``): A fixed time span written as digits followed by a "
"single unit letter (``s``, ``m``, ``h``, or ``d``). For example, ``\"5m"
"\"`` compresses 1-minute bars into 5-minute bars."
msgstr ""
"**时长** （``str``）：以数字加单个单位字母（``s``、``m``、``h`` 或 ``d``）"
"表示的固定时间跨度。例如，``\"5m\"`` 会将 1 分钟 K 线压缩为 5 分钟 K 线。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:29 Multiple Time
#: c4e007b495e44bb0bca1c172d2bfe2da
msgid ""
"**Calendar** (``str``): Aligns exactly to standard calendar boundaries "
"using one of the following options:"
msgstr "**日历** （``str``）：使用以下选项之一，精确对齐到标准日历边界："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 9eee1e7ec2b648b2a9abedeb4256194a
#: Intervals.ipynb:32 Multiple Time
msgid "Calendar String"
msgstr "日历字符串"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:32 Multiple Time
#: e3a5032ea661405ea911cf667d9b7d5f
msgid "Boundary Alignment"
msgstr "边界对齐"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 77714257175f4c61a24977134b81c0b1
#: Intervals.ipynb:34 Multiple Time
msgid "``\"daily\"``"
msgstr "``\"daily\"``"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:34 Multiple Time
#: a52bde614435455d9a6acc40df3e1cfa
msgid "Standard daily boundary."
msgstr "标准的每日边界。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:35 Multiple Time
#: d121c297ef3249779e5c1b30d42c7b9c
msgid "``\"weekly\"``"
msgstr "``\"weekly\"``"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:35 Multiple Time
#: acf51587a1974e548fcee99e32889730
msgid "Starts on Monday."
msgstr "从周一开始。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 0c08ab1ec8844059ba62f67a06bbebda
#: Intervals.ipynb:36 Multiple Time
msgid "``\"monthly\"``"
msgstr "``\"monthly\"``"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:36 Multiple Time
#: fd88c9a1234f4da3827f9b3726e9ffe9
msgid "Starts on the 1st of the month."
msgstr "从每月 1 日开始。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 1ce29e0ad2bd4e458464ffdad4f02da8
#: Intervals.ipynb:37 Multiple Time
msgid "``\"quarterly\"``"
msgstr "``\"quarterly\"``"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:37 Multiple Time
#: b981edd9c08c4250a2ce057a83812f41
msgid "Begins in January, April, July, and October."
msgstr "从 1 月、4 月、7 月和 10 月开始。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 296dd7592f1d4fd3976e04d8808b9143
#: Intervals.ipynb:38 Multiple Time
msgid "``\"yearly\"``"
msgstr "``\"yearly\"``"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:38 Multiple Time
#: c9e9eb592ef74261a5e7d39d4234640f
msgid "Starts on January 1."
msgstr "从 1 月 1 日开始。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:41 Multiple Time
#: f9442e107664449cbc8d64956603c7b0
msgid ""
"Your chosen interval must always be strictly coarser than the bars being "
"compressed. For example, if you fetch daily bars from `YFinance <https://"
"www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data."
"YFinance>`__, ``\"weekly\"`` and ``\"monthly\"`` are valid intervals. "
"Attempting to use ``\"daily\"`` or ``\"1h\"`` will raise a ``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
"你所选择的时间区间必须始终严格粗于被压缩的 K 线。例如，如果你从 `YFinance "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker."
"data.YFinance>`__ 获取日线数据，那么 ``\"weekly\"`` 和 ``\"monthly\"`` 都"
"是有效的时间区间。尝试使用 ``\"daily\"`` 或 ``\"1h\"`` 将引发 "
"``ValueError``。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 8dc40ca653bd49d8a9fdbea707f39e17
#: Intervals.ipynb:43 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"Before using intervals in a strategy, let's build some intuition by "
"compressing bars directly. We will start by downloading daily data:"
msgstr ""
"在策略中使用时间区间之前，让我们先通过直接压缩 K 线来建立一些直观认识。我"
"们将从下载日线数据开始："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:313 Multiple Time
#: f7a7fec27ec5411b99d3d3a2e4056312
msgid "Compressing Bars"
msgstr "压缩 K 线"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 4e8ad34525bb4ad997e2593493271a10
#: Intervals.ipynb:315 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"The `compress_bars <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker."
"interval.html#pybroker.interval.compress_bars>`__ function converts "
"single-symbol OHLCV data (either a `Pandas DataFrame <https://pandas."
"pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.DataFrame.html>`__ or `BarData "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common."
"html#pybroker.common.BarData>`__) to a coarser interval, returning the "
"result as a new `BarData <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/"
"pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.BarData>`__ object. Every compressed "
"bar is timestamped with the date of the last base bar it contains."
msgstr ""
"`compress_bars <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker."
"interval.html#pybroker.interval.compress_bars>`__ 函数可将单品种的 OHLCV "
"数据（可以是 `Pandas DataFrame <https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/"
"api/pandas.DataFrame.html>`__ 或 `BarData <https://www.pybroker.com/en/"
"latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.BarData>`__）转换为"
"更粗粒度的时间区间，并以新的 `BarData <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/"
"reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.BarData>`__ 对象形式返回结"
"果。每根压缩后的 K 线都以其所包含的最后一根基础 K 线的日期作为时间戳。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 427bbfd5c08b46cc8b4f2bc63c8a0ccb
#: Intervals.ipynb:318 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"When grouping base bars into a compressed bar, the data is aggregated as "
"follows:"
msgstr "在将基础 K 线分组为压缩 K 线时，数据将按以下方式聚合："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:320 Multiple Time
#: e8d05ed3b4044a43a61ed823f69b8409
msgid "**Open:** Taken from the first base bar."
msgstr "**开盘价：** 取自第一根基础 K 线。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:321 Multiple Time
#: b1a91b4599094fdfb01a8bb7c343c675
msgid "**High / Low:** The highest high and lowest low."
msgstr "**最高价 / 最低价：** 取最高价中的最高值和最低价中的最低值。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:322 Multiple Time
#: ef20e0fd28574bc689e6a417817ac99e
msgid "**Close:** Taken from the last base bar."
msgstr "**收盘价：** 取自最后一根基础 K 线。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 9ffb53cab635404c9835803ca4a4958d
#: Intervals.ipynb:323 Multiple Time
msgid "**Volume:** The sum of the volumes."
msgstr "**成交量：** 各成交量之和。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:324 Multiple Time
#: cebe73132b7f4faa983b5e784a7b0046
msgid "**VWAP:** The volume-weighted average."
msgstr "**VWAP：** 成交量加权平均价。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 70db83a9e6be493ba24029838a8dd348
#: Intervals.ipynb:325 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"**Custom columns:** The last value in the period (e.g., `YFinance "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker."
"data.YFinance>`__'s ``adj_close``)."
msgstr ""
"**自定义列：** 取该周期内的最后一个值（例如 `YFinance <https://www."
"pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data."
"YFinance>`__ 的 ``adj_close``）。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:327 Multiple Time
#: e2d79d7b43e14032b0ac74058046def1
msgid ""
"You must also supply the ``base_timeframe`` parameter to declare the "
"spacing of your input bars (for example, ``\"1d\"`` for daily data)."
msgstr ""
"你还必须提供 ``base_timeframe`` 参数，以声明输入 K 线的间隔（例如，日线数"
"据对应 ``\"1d\"``）。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 57444fa57c9044f890bf153455bd15e4
#: Intervals.ipynb:329 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"Let's compress AMD into calendar weeks and view the result as a `Pandas "
"DataFrame <https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.DataFrame."
"html>`__ with `bars_to_df <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/"
"pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.bars_to_df>`__:"
msgstr ""
"让我们将 AMD 压缩为日历周，并使用 `bars_to_df <https://www.pybroker.com/"
"en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.bars_to_df>`__ 将"
"结果显示为 `Pandas DataFrame <https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/"
"api/pandas.DataFrame.html>`__："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 48148032e0164077b75edd021bc96764
#: Intervals.ipynb:509 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"Every-n-bars compression works the same way. In this example, every ``5`` "
"daily bars become one bar:"
msgstr ""
"每 n 根 K 线压缩的方式相同。在此示例中，每 ``5`` 根日线合并为一根 K 线："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:685 Multiple Time
#: eea58c4d90c4453182a50795c617133b
msgid "A Multi-Timeframe Strategy"
msgstr "多时间框架策略"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:687 Multiple Time
#: a48c092178de4abb8d9f1629dd27e231
msgid ""
"When building a backtest, you can declare higher timeframes by passing "
"the ``intervals`` parameter to `add_execution <https://www.pybroker.com/"
"en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy."
"add_execution>`__. Your execution function can then read these compressed "
"bars through `ctx.interval <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/"
"pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval>`__, which "
"returns a read-only `IntervalContext <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/"
"reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.IntervalContext>`__. The "
"``intervals`` parameter provides bars only. Indicators and models are "
"never computed on these intervals unless you bind them explicitly, as "
"shown in the later sections."
msgstr ""
"在构建回测时，你可以通过向 `add_execution <https://www.pybroker.com/en/"
"latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy."
"add_execution>`__ 传递 ``intervals`` 参数来声明更高的时间框架。随后，你的"
"执行函数便可通过 `ctx.interval <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/"
"reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval>`__ "
"读取这些压缩后的 K 线，该方法会返回一个只读的 `IntervalContext <https://"
"www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker."
"context.IntervalContext>`__。 ``intervals`` 参数仅提供 K 线数据。除非像后"
"续章节那样显式绑定，否则指标和模型永远不会在这些区间上计算。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 9803613ef5144b6090197617149b253b
#: Intervals.ipynb:690 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"To prevent look-ahead bias, `ctx.interval <https://www.pybroker.com/en/"
"latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext."
"interval>`__ only ever exposes *completed* bars. The week or month that "
"is currently forming is never visible, ensuring that future data cannot "
"leak into your daily trading decisions."
msgstr ""
"为防止前视偏差，`ctx.interval <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/"
"reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval>`__ "
"只会公开 *已完成* 的 K 线。当前正在形成的这一周或这一月永远不可见，从而确"
"保未来数据不会泄漏到你的每日交易决策中。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:692 Multiple Time
#: cb452716f9444e0baa77bc556de731bb
msgid ""
"To demonstrate this, we will execute trades on daily bars and assign a "
"specific job to each higher timeframe."
msgstr ""
"为了演示这一点，我们将在日线上执行交易，并为每个更高的时间框架分配特定任"
"务。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:694 Multiple Time
#: bf6a7d20addb43f1803519f1c57f73d8
msgid ""
"**Monthly (Regime):** Only enter when the last completed monthly close is "
"higher than the close from three months ago."
msgstr ""
"**月线（市场状态）：** 仅当最后一根已完成的月线收盘价高于三个月前的收盘价"
"时才建仓。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 55b206ab7bac469fbb0ff0fbaa1ba576
#: Intervals.ipynb:695 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"**Weekly (Trend):** Only enter when the last completed weekly close is "
"higher than the close from ten weeks ago, and exit when it falls below."
msgstr ""
"**周线（趋势）：** 仅当最后一根已完成的周线收盘价高于十周前的收盘价时才建"
"仓，跌破时平仓。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 4bfe05db76824a9b866511c7459f8854
#: Intervals.ipynb:696 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"**Daily (Timing):** Enter on the first daily close above the last "
"completed weekly close."
msgstr ""
"**日线（择时）：** 在首根日线收盘价高于最后一根已完成的周线收盘价时建仓。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 34033492d0e2477dabc90f0a60403a25
#: Intervals.ipynb:1054 Multiple Time
msgid "Binding an Indicator to an Interval"
msgstr "将指标绑定到区间"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 025d6730aa714b6d964962ce80fff8d0
#: Intervals.ipynb:1056 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"To compute an indicator on compressed bars, bind it to one or more "
"intervals with `Indicator.intervals(...) <https://www.pybroker.com/en/"
"latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.Indicator."
"intervals>`__."
msgstr ""
"要在压缩 K 线上计算指标，请使用 `Indicator.intervals(...) <https://www."
"pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker."
"indicator.Indicator.intervals>`__ 将其绑定到一个或多个区间。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:1058 Multiple Time
#: f71447126fcc497e9f34cdb391caefb4
msgid ""
"The example below upgrades the weekly trend rule to compare the weekly "
"close against a 10-bar SMA calculated from the weekly bars:"
msgstr ""
"下面的示例升级了周线趋势规则，将周线收盘价与基于周线计算的 10 根 K 线 SMA "
"进行比较："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:1106 Multiple Time
#: d2ba969f914649d3a6f714157eae575b
msgid ""
"**PyBroker** automatically unions bound intervals with the execution's "
"``intervals`` parameter, and the ``\"weekly\"`` interval in the example "
"is made accessible via `ctx.interval(\"weekly\") <https://www.pybroker."
"com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context."
"ExecContext.interval>`__. The ``intervals`` parameter only needs to "
"specify ``\"monthly\"``, which provides the raw monthly bars."
msgstr ""
"**PyBroker** 会自动将已绑定的区间与执行函数的 ``intervals`` 参数取并集，因"
"此示例中的 ``\"weekly\"`` 区间可通过 `ctx.interval(\"weekly\") <https://"
"www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker."
"context.ExecContext.interval>`__ 访问。此时 ``intervals`` 参数只需指定 ``"
"\"monthly\"``，用于提供原始的月线数据。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 966de452fa2c48379bcf2dfacc2591c4
#: Intervals.ipynb:1108 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"Note that binding will override computing the indicator on the base "
"timeframe of the data source. Passing ``\"base\"`` to `Indicator."
"intervals() <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker."
"indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.Indicator.intervals>`__ will then also "
"compute the indicator on the base timeframe of the data source."
msgstr ""
"请注意，绑定会覆盖在数据源基础时间框架上计算该指标的行为。若要同时在数据源"
"的基础时间框架上计算该指标，需向 `Indicator.intervals() <https://www."
"pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker."
"indicator.Indicator.intervals>`__ 传入 ``\"base\"``。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 870a15fc5591422aa85c35bfa396574d
#: Intervals.ipynb:1499 Multiple Time
msgid "Training a Model on an Interval"
msgstr "在区间上训练模型"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:1501 Multiple Time
#: a70af15800934b399c9d3dfa2477dc6b
msgid ""
"You can bind models in the exact same way with `ModelSource."
"intervals(...) <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker."
"model.html#pybroker.model.ModelSource.intervals>`__. **PyBroker** will "
"train models for each interval using the interval's compressed bars and "
"any registered indicators. You can then access the per-interval "
"predictions by calling the `preds <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/"
"reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.IntervalContext."
"preds>`__ method on that interval's context."
msgstr ""
"你可以用完全相同的方式，通过 `ModelSource.intervals(...) <https://www."
"pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model."
"ModelSource.intervals>`__ 绑定模型。**PyBroker** 会使用该区间的压缩 K 线以"
"及任何已注册的指标，为每个区间训练模型。随后，你可以在该区间的上下文上调"
"用 `preds <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context."
"html#pybroker.context.IntervalContext.preds>`__ 方法来获取该区间的预测结"
"果。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 77eae5afa29547dc845db3e6f65b0e31
#: Intervals.ipynb:1504 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"We train a `LinearRegression <https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/"
"generated/sklearn.linear_model.LinearRegression.html>`__ model to predict "
"the next weekly return from the weekly close:"
msgstr ""
"我们训练一个 `LinearRegression <https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/"
"generated/sklearn.linear_model.LinearRegression.html>`__ 模型，根据周线收"
"盘价预测下一周的收益率："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:1556 Multiple Time
#: c4d8eddf5e994d65a4a5009c6efc2d55
msgid ""
"During `Walkforward Analysis <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/"
"reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy."
"walkforward>`__, the ``lookahead`` between an interval model's train and "
"test data is enforced using the compressed-bar units to prevent future "
"leakage."
msgstr ""
"在 `Walkforward Analysis <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/"
